Does anybody think that all those polearm weapons are necessary?  I get the
impression that they're just "filler" weapons so that we're not always
finding axes, swords and flails, etc.  I think that we could stick with
spears, javelins, and halberds (maybe), and all that extra bill-guisarme
voulge junk could be thrown away, especially in light of the fact that
the long weapons aren't really appropriate for underground melee, in 
hallways and tight corners and such.
    
